    {
      "word": "ganga,",
      "class": "Substantivu",
      "meaning": "Hena forte ida neʼebé uza hodi halo kalsa-serbisu no roupa seluk neʼebé tuir moda."
    },
    {
      "word": "Ganjes, (Mota-),",
      "class": "Substantivu",
      "meaning": "Mota naruk tebes ida neʼebé hahú iha Foho-Himalaia no suli liuhosi rai-Bangladexe no rai-Índia."
