  {
    "word": "irresponsavel",
    "class": "Adjetivu",
    "meaning": "Neʼebé hatudu ati-tude responsavel. Sin. laresponsavel, latesak Ez. Empregadu nee bele halo aat projetu tomak ho nia hahalok irrespo-nsavel."
