  {
    "word": "orizonte",
    "class": "Substantivu",
    "meaning": "Liña iha distánsia dook neʼebé ita haree hanesan lalehan kona rai ka tasi. Sin. rai-hun"
  },
  {
    "word": "orkestra",
    "class": "Substantivu",
    "meaning": "Múziku grupu ka lubun boot ida neʼebé toka hamutuk, no baibain múzika klásika. Verbu 1. Prepara múzika ba poezia ida atu orkestra ida bele toka tiha. 2. Fó aten-barani hosi kotukotuk ba ema hala'o atividade ruma. Ez. Polísia kaer joven sira neebé asalta edifísiu governu nian maibé sira seidauk hatene sé loos mak orkestra akontesimentu sira-nee hotu."
  },
  {
    "word": "orkidea",
    "class": "Substantivu",
    "meaning": "Tipu ai-funan furak hanesanliiskarauboothovariedadeoioin; iha rai-Timór ita bele hetan ai-funan ne'e neʼebé ema hasai hosi nia hun no kuda fali iha nuu-kulit. Sin. loubaik"
  },
  {
    "word": "ormona",
    "class": "Substantivu",
    "meaning": "Been neʼebé fusin ka glándula ida hasai atu halo organ ruma funsiona di'ak."
  },
  {
    "word": "oróskopu",
    "class": "Substantivu",
    "meaning": "Sasi'ik ida kona-ba saida mak sei bele akontese ba ema ida, bazeia ba loro no fitun sira-nia pozisaun iha lalehan bainhira nia moris."
  },
  {
    "word": "orrivel",
    "class": "Adjetivu",
    "meaning": "Neʼebé feiu ka aat liu. Sin. maridak Ez. Xefe nia hahalok orrivel liu tanba loroloron nia hirus no hakilar nia pesoál sira."
  },
  {
    "word": "orrór",
