  {
    "word": "pantera (busa--)",
    "class": "Substantivu",
    "meaning": "Balada maksusuk fuik no si'ak ida, leopardu oin ida maibé ho fulun metan, la’ós kinur no taka hopontubarakhanesanleopardubaibain. Naran-sientífiku: Panthera pardus"
