  {
    "word": "paradeiru",
    "class": "Substantivu",
    "meaning": "Ema ida nia hela-fatin bainhira sai tiha hosi fatin uluk; ema ida iha neʼebé loos bainhira ita buka hela nia. Ez. Ami la hatene Sr. Mauhudu nia paradeiru bainhira ema-aat sira kaer tiha nia."
  },
  {
